00:11:20,000 --> 00:11:26,000
Seven Years in Tibet is a adventure, drama, history
film directed by Jean-Jacques Annaud.

3
00:17:00,000 --> 00:17:06,000
Austrian mountaineer Heinrich Harrer journeys to the Himalayas
without his family to head an expedition in 1939.

4
00:22:40,000 --> 00:22:46,000
But when World War II breaks out, the arrogant Harrer falls
into Allied forces' hands as a prisoner of war.

5
00:28:20,000 --> 00:28:26,000
He escapes with a fellow detainee and makes his way to Lhasa, Tibet, where he meets the
14-year-old Dalai Lama, whose friendship ultimately transforms his outlook on life.

